flowchart TD
    A[Main Menu] -->|Start Run| B[Initialize Party and Run State]
    B --> C[Enter 3D Room]
    C --> D[Explore as Selected Leader]
    D --> E{Room Interaction}
    E -->|Enemy Encounter| F[Blend to Fixed Battle Camera]
    E -->|Merchant| G[Trade]
    E -->|Chest or Resource| H[Collect Reward]
    E -->|Event| I[Choose Responders and Resolve]
    E -->|Door| J{Exit Available?}
    F --> K[Turn-Based Party Combat]
    K --> L{Combat Result}
    L -->|Victory| M[Rewards and Inherent Skill Learning]
    L -->|Defeat| N{Retry or Abandon}
    N -->|Retry| F
    N -->|Abandon| A
    M --> O[Return to Room Exploration]
    G --> D
    H --> D
    I --> D
    O --> D
    J -->|No| D
    J -->|Yes| P{Boss Cleared?}
    P -->|No| C
    P -->|Yes| Q[Run Complete]
    Q --> A
